   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP CBRD, CST Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det inbegriper 3 komponenter: 1) County Support Teams (CST) syftar till att st&#xe4;rka kapacitet av administration, monitoring och statistik p&#xe5; p&#xe5; regional niv&#xe5; 2)Community Based Recovery and Development Project (CBRD)syftar till att &#xe5;teruppbygga och utveckla infrastruktur och inkomstm&#xf6;jligheter 3) CIMM-tj&#xe4;nst systematisk informations- och datainsamling i regionerna d&#xe4;r CST existerar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support contains the components: 1. County Support Teams (CST). Aims at strengthening the capacity of county officials, improve data management, and restore admin. building. 2. Community Based Recovery and Development Project (CBRD). Aims at improving infrastructure for livelihoods, skills training for employment etc. 3. CIMM-staff for systematic information and data collection in counties where CST work</narrative>
  </description>
